OL,3,GNEWSAWomen and babies not always safe
OL,4,Aat hospital - CQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaternity services at a Sussex hospital
OL,7,Fhave been downgraded from good to
OL,8,Frequires improvement by the Care
OL,9,FQuality Commission (CQC).
OL,11,FAn inspection of Worthing Hospital in
OL,12,FApril found issues relating tob@/safe
OL,13,Fcare and treatment, and overall
OL,14,Fmanagement.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32802
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1790141193
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWomen and babies not always safe
OL,4,Aat hospital - CQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmanda Williams, CQC deputy director of
OL,7,Fhospitals, secondary and specialist
OL,8,Fcare in Sussex, said though it was
OL,9,Fclear some action had been taken to
OL,10,Faddress concerns from a previous
OL,11,Finspection, "progress was slow and the
OL,12,Fservice still wasn't consistently
OL,13,Fkeeping women and babies safe".
OL,15,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex NHS
OL,16,FFoundation Trust said it recognised
OL,17,Fthere was "more to do" and it remained
OL,18,F"committed to listening to women and
OL,19,Ffamilies".
